## 🤖 AGENT: @plan

Chỉ gọi **1 lần** ở đầu dự án.

**Thứ tự bắt buộc:**

1. Đọc toàn bộ đề bài.

2. Tạo `docs/00-overview.md`:
   - ASCII diagram hệ thống
   - Payment state machine: PENDING → DECIDED / REVIEW / BLOCKED
   - Bảng so sánh variant A/B/C/D

3. Tạo `docs/PLAN.md`:

```
PHASE 0 — Setup
  0.1  Scaffold: Gradle multi-module, common/, api-service/, docker-compose
  0.2  DB migrations (Flyway): payments, risk_events, feature_cache
  0.3  Domain entities + Payment state machine (enum + transitions)
  0.4  Repository layer (Spring Data JPA) + idempotency query
  0.5  Docker-compose: PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka/RabbitMQ, Prometheus

PHASE 1 — Variant A: Monolith (baseline)
  1.1  Spring Boot app + 4 REST endpoints (skeleton, trả 200 OK)
  1.2  Pipeline trong 1 thread: Ingest→Feature→Model→Rule→Decision
  1.3  @Transactional + idempotency: UNIQUE(merchant_id, idempotency_key)
  1.4  Webhook mock (chỉ log)
  1.5  Micrometer metrics: Counter + Timer + Gauge
  1.6  Benchmark uniform → docs/benchmark/A-uniform.txt

PHASE 2 — Variant B: Thread Pool (ExecutorService)
  2.1  ThreadPoolExecutor: cấu hình coreSize, maxSize, queue capacity
  2.2  Model scoring chạy trong pool — async với CompletableFuture
  2.3  Backpressure: RejectedExecutionHandler → HTTP 429
  2.4  Graceful shutdown: awaitTermination + in-flight tracking
  2.5  Benchmark + so sánh với A

PHASE 3 — Variant C: Kafka Pipeline
  3.1  Kafka topics: risk.ingest, risk.feature, risk.model, risk.rule, risk.dlq
  3.2  @KafkaListener với AcknowledgeMode.MANUAL — ack sau khi xử lý xong
  3.3  Ingest consumer: validate, produce to risk.feature
  3.4  Feature consumer: enrich, produce downstream
  3.5  Model consumer: scoring, produce downstream
  3.6  Rule consumer: quyết định, ghi DB, webhook
  3.7  DLQ: @RetryableTopic — max 3 lần, sau đó vào risk.dlq
  3.8  Idempotency theo (payment_id, step) dùng DB unique constraint
  3.9  Benchmark + so sánh

PHASE 4 — Variant D: Per-merchant Routing (RabbitMQ)
  4.1  Exchange risk.direct + queues theo merchant_id (routing key)
  4.2  Publisher: route message theo merchant_id
  4.3  Consumer: 1 process per merchant shard (prefetchCount=1)
  4.4  Per-tenant rate-limit (RateLimiter per merchantId)
  4.5  Benchmark + so sánh

PHASE 5 — Observability & Report
  5.1  OpenTelemetry Java Agent: auto-instrument + custom span per stage
  5.2  Grafana dashboard: queue depth + tail latency
  5.3  REPORT.md: bảng p50/p95/p99, phân tích, khuyến nghị
```

4. Commit:
```
git add docs/
git commit -m "docs: add architecture overview and implementation plan"
```

5. Hỏi user: **"Plan xong! Gọi `@step 0.1` để bắt đầu nhé?"**

